    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuuth Yecu Kritho mëë ca ka̱m jɛ ɛ Kuoth kɛ ɣöö bɛ ja̱ŋdɛ nyuɔ̱th tin bi bi dhil ben kɛ gua̱a̱th mi tɔt. Kä cuɛ jɛ jakä ŋa̱ckɛ, mëë cɛ jääkdɛ jäkä ja̱ŋdɛ ni Jɔ̱ɔ̱n, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mëë cu nëndɛ lat kɛ kui̱ ruac Kuɔth kɛnɛ thuk ruaacni Yecu Kritho, amäni ti diaal tëë cɛ nɛn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Puɔ̱th akɛ ram mi kuɛɛn ruaacni go̱o̱kä ti̱ti̱, kä puɔ̱th akɛ nɛy tin cikɛ li̱ŋ, kä kääp min ca gɔ̱a̱r thi̱n, kɛ ɣöö ci gua̱a̱th thia̱k.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ner duëli Kuɔth da̱ŋ bärɔw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jɔ̱ɔ̱n gɔ̱rɛ mɛmɛ duël Kuɔth da̱ŋ bärɔw tin te kä E-cia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A puɔ̱th kɛnɛ mal tekɛ yɛ, min bëë kä ram in te thi̱n, kä ci kɔŋ te thi̱n, kä bi ben. Min bä kä yiey da̱ŋ bärɔw tin te nhiam kɔam kuäärädɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä bä kä Yecu Kritho in la neen in ŋa̱thkɛ, jɛn kɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ nɛɛni ti ci li̱w, kä kuäär kua̱ri wec muɔ̱ɔ̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä jɛn nhɔkɛ kɔn, kä cɛ kɔn lony rɛy dueerikɔn kɛ riɛmdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cɛ kɔn jakä kuäär bööthni palä ti la̱tkɛ Kuoth ikä kɛnɛ Gua̱a̱r. Kä a gɔɔy kɛnɛ buɔ̱m tekɛ Yecu amäni cäŋ kɛl. Inɔnɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ɛ ɣän ram min jio̱l kä ɛ ɣän ram min jɔak,” ruac ni Kuäär ni Kuoth, min te thi̱n, kä ci kɔŋ te thi̱n, kä bi ben, min Leny Buɔ̱mdɛ ti Diaal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyuuth Kritho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän dämuɔɔrun ni Jɔ̱ɔ̱n, min nyuak rik kɛ yɛ kɛnɛ kuäär amäni ruɔ̱t kä ti bɛ̈c bɛ̈ɛ̈c rɛy Yecu. Ɣän ca ɣä la̱th wi̱i̱ dhuulä mi cɔali Pɛ̈t-mɔth kɛ kui̱ ruac Kuɔth kɛnɛ nyuuth Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän ta̱a̱ rɛy yieekä kɛ cäŋ Kua̱r ni Kuoth, kä cua jɔw mi di̱i̱t mi ce̱tkɛ jɔw kaaŋä liŋ jɔkdä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wëë i̱, “Gɔ̱ri min ci nɛn rɛy warɛgakä kä jäkni jɛ kä duël Kuɔth da̱ŋ bärɔw, kä Ɛ-pɛ-thäth, kɛ Thɛ-mer-na kɛnɛ Per-ga-mäm, kɛ Thay-tay-ra, Thar-dith, kɛnɛ Pi-la-dɛl-pia amäni La-o-di-thia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua rɔɔdä ri̱t kɛ ɣöö bä ram in ruac jɔkdä nɛn. Kä mëë cä liɛc, cua cuuŋni lɛmbärni da̱ŋ bärɔw ti ca la̱t kɛ da̱a̱p nɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä te ram mi ce̱tkɛ Gat Ran däär cuuŋni lɛmbärni, mi tekɛ bi̱i̱ mi bäär, kɛ la̱a̱k dääpä mi ca riɛth thok lɔaacdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä buɔy wi̱cdɛ ɛ pak ce̱tnikɛ kën. Kä ce̱t wäŋkɛ kɛ bo̱l maac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ce̱t ciökɛ kɛ ciɛk in yian mi ca toth, bo̱lɛ ce̱tnikɛ mac tha̱t yieethä, kä ce̱t jɔwdɛ kɛ wuɔ̱w pi̱i̱ni ti ŋuan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä jɛn rɔmɛ kuɛl da̱ŋ bärɔw kɛ tet cuëëcdɛ, kä bä thɛp mi moth kui̱nikɛ da̱ŋ rɛw raar thokdɛ. Buɔy nhiamdɛ ce̱tkɛ cäŋ mi ci lɛ̈p a thil nyäŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cä jɛ nɛn, cua rɔ yuɔr piny ciöknikɛ ce̱tkɛ mi cä li̱w. Kä duundɛ ɣöö cuɛ tet cuëëcdɛ la̱th wi̱i̱dä, wëë i̱, “/Cu dual. Ɛ ɣän ram in jio̱l, kä ɛ ɣän ram min jɔak, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä ɛ ɣän ram in tëk. Ɣän cä li̱w, kä nɛnɛ ɣän tëkä amäni cäŋ kɛl. Ɣän ta̱a̱kɛ leepni li̱eth kɛnɛ ro̱l jɔɔkni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ gɔ̱r min ci nɛn, min te thi̱n amäni min bi ben kɔɔr kä nɛmɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mɛmɛ ɛ jɛn luɔt kä min dhal ji̱ kɛ kui̱ kuɛli da̱ŋ bärɔw tin ci nɛn tetdä cuëëcdä, kɛnɛ cuuŋni lɛmbärni dääpä da̱ŋ bärɔw. Kä kɛn kuɛl da̱ŋ bärɔw kɛ ja̱a̱k nhial duëli Kuɔth da̱ŋ bärɔw, kä cuuŋni lɛmbärni da̱ŋ bärɔw kɛ kɛn duël Kuɔth da̱ŋ bärɔw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
